\newlabel{fig:fidelity-vs-correctness}{{3}{10}{\textbf {Policy Transfer Does Not Predict Routing Accuracy.} Teacher F1 (x-axis, fidelity) vs.\ oracle F1 (y-axis, correctness) for route-only (RO) and reasoning-plus-route (RR) at all four configurations (same marker convention as Figure~\ref {fig:pareto}), the full rows of Table~\ref {tab:teacher-oracle-accuracy}. Dashed connectors join same-configuration pairs; error bars are $\pm 1$ SD across 10 seeds}{figure.caption.10}{}}
